        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "refactor(plugins): centralize timing-safe secret comparisons",
        "body": "Closes #105969\n\nRelated: #58432\n\n## What Problem This Solves\n\nSix bundled plugin authentication/signature paths duplicated constant-time secret comparison logic. That expanded the security audit surface and allowed individual implementations to drift from the shared comparator.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nRoutes the Nextcloud Talk, LINE, Slack, Raft, Browser relay, and Telegram Mini App checks through `safeEqualSecret` from the registered `openclaw/plugin-sdk/security-runtime` seam. Removes the compare-only helpers and copied comments, preserves each caller's type and non-empty guards, and lowers the Slack source LOC baseline.\n\nFor the two hash-then-compare implementations, comparing their source strings is equivalent or stronger: `safeEqualSecret` pads the UTF-8 byte arrays to equal length, always calls `timingSafeEqual`, and separately requires the original byte lengths to match. Telegram continues comparing the already-computed HMAC hex digests; Browser compares the relay token strings directly.\n\nAI-assisted: Codex.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNo intended user-visible behavior change. Valid signatures and tokens remain accepted; invalid, tampered, and length-mismatched values remain rejected. Non-test implementation LOC decreases.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Blacksmith Testbox through Crabbox: `tbx_01kxcssjcw01c6rcxe78eytehw` / [Actions run 29222693193](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/29222693193)\n- `pnpm format:check` on all touched TypeScript files\n- `pnpm test extensions/nextcloud-talk` — 114 passed\n- `pnpm test extensions/line` — 316 passed\n- `pnpm test extensions/slack` — 1,874 passed\n- `pnpm test extensions/raft` — 11 passed\n- `pnpm test extensions/browser` — 1,943 passed, 1 skipped\n- `pnpm test extensions/telegram` — 2,726 passed\n- Fresh `autoreview` — clean, no accepted/actionable findings\n- `pnpm check:changed` reaches the global TypeScript LOC ratchet; current `main` already exceeds unrelated baselines outside this patch. This patch's only baseline change lowers `extensions/slack/src/send.ts` from 1,422 to 1,412.\n",
